{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99129","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99129/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99129/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99129/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99129","id":2652571774,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc6eGwh-","number":99129,"title":"Exiting a running game with a texture bound to a global shader parameter causes a hang and an error.","user":{"login":"bbbscarter","id":930043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter","html_url":"https://github.com/bbbscarter","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2024-11-12T15:40:51Z","updated_at":"2025-06-05T15:44:42Z","closed_at":"2024-11-13T20:34:16Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot Engine v4.3.stable.mono.official\r\n- Using C#.\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS 15.1, any renderer\n\n### Issue description\n\nExiting the game causes a hang and the following error:\r\n```\r\nERROR: FATAL: Condition \"!rc_owner\" is true.\r\n   at: _instance_binding_reference_callback (modules/mono/csharp_script.cpp:1237)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis starts happening after using C# to create a texture and bind it to a global shader parameter.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Create a global shader parameter of type sampler2D called \"texture_test\" in the editor.\r\n2. Create and bind a texture to it in code:\r\n```\r\npublic override void _Ready() {\r\n  var _testImage = new Image();\r\n  _testImage = Image.CreateEmpty(256, 256, false, Image.Format.Rgba8);\r\n  var _testTexture = ImageTexture.CreateFromImage(_testImage);\r\n\r\n  RenderingServer.GlobalShaderParameterSet(\"texture_test\", _testTexture);\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. Run the game and try to exit by pressing the red quit button. Notice the game hangs. \r\n\r\n4. Put in the following code and notice the hang goes away:\r\n```\r\npublic override void _ExitTree() {\r\n  RenderingServer.GlobalShaderParameterSet(\"texture_test\", new Variant());\r\n  base._ExitTree();\r\n}\r\n```\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[hang-on-exit.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/17718759/hang-on-exit.zip)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"bbbscarter","id":930043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkzMDA0Mw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/930043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bbbscarter","html_url":"https://github.com/bbbscarter","followers_url":"htt